{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"title":"Service Reference"},"abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the RevenueCat-backed ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformer that the paywall plugin consumes.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"Reference","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/UIComponentsReference"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Reference"}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" adapts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCat.Purchases"},{"type":"text","text":" to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall.PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" requires. It does one job: translate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" (defined by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall"},{"text":") so the plugin can drive its state. Configuration of the RevenueCat SDK itself remains the caller’s responsibility.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For a step-by-step integration walkthrough, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". For the entitlement-mapping rules, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Library target","anchor":"Library-target"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product: "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Types","anchor":"Types","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"``doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService``","anchor":"docSwiduxRevenueCatPaywalldocumentationSwiduxRevenueCatPaywallRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["public struct RevenueCatPaywallService: PaywallService {","    public init(","        entitlementID: String,","        permanentLicenseEntitlementID: String? = nil","    )","","    public func customerInfo() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot","    public func customerInfoStream() -> AsyncStream<EntitlementSnapshot>","    public func restorePurchases() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value type. Holds two "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identifiers and forwards configured calls to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It is safe to construct before ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywall.configure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs. For production, wrap it in SwiduxPaywall’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResilientPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so a transient read failure at launch never gates a paid user as free.","type":"text"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Initializer","anchor":"Initializer","type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["public init(","    entitlementID: String,","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: String? = nil",")"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"entitlementID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — RevenueCat entitlement identifier that grants pro access. Surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"permanentLicenseEntitlementID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Optional secondary identifier for a lifetime \/ permanent entitlement. Surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot.hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":" when active. Pass ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if the app has no separate lifetime SKU.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywall\/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" before invoking the service. Construction before configuration is safe, including from a stored-property initializer. Previews and tests that do not configure RevenueCat should still use "},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when they need entitlement values."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"`customerInfo() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot`","anchor":"customerInfo-async-throws-%3E-EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One-shot fetch. Calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared.customerInfo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and maps the result. A response older than five minutes by ","type":"text"},{"code":"requestDate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is labelled ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cache"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping#Live-and-cached-customer-info"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before configuration, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/verificationFailed","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for failed signature verification, or an SDK error. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ResilientPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" can serve a valid same-account cache after a failed read; without a fallback the plugin dispatches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed(message)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"`customerInfoStream() -> AsyncStream<EntitlementSnapshot>`","anchor":"customerInfoStream-%3E-AsyncStream%3CEntitlementSnapshot%3E"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Long-lived stream. Wraps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Purchases.shared.customerInfoStream"},{"type":"text","text":" and yields a new "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" for each valid change RevenueCat reports. A failed-verification element is skipped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream finishes when the underlying RevenueCat stream finishes. The plugin’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".observeCustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" effect normally keeps it alive for the duration of the session; cancel by cancelling the consuming "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"type":"text","text":", which terminates the stream and tears down the bridge."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before configuration, the stream logs a fault and finishes immediately. Swidux 1.9 and later clears its observation guard when the stream ends, so configure RevenueCat and dispatch "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".observeCustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" again to retry."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream buffers only the newest snapshot: each yield is a complete entitlement state, so a slow consumer sees the latest value rather than replaying stale intermediate states."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new stream first yields the customer info RevenueCat last delivered in this process, if any. RevenueCat may not have delivered one yet — on a relaunch with a fresh cache it skips the launch fetch — and then the stream stays silent until the next change, so dispatch "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshCustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" alongside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".observeCustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" to seed the state."}]},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"`restorePurchases() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot`","anchor":"restorePurchases-async-throws-%3E-EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the result of RevenueCat’s user-initiated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"restorePurchases()"},{"type":"text","text":" flow in every purchase-completion mode. Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"syncPurchases()"},{"type":"text","text":", this flow refreshes the App Store receipt and can recover a subscription missing from the device receipt. It may show an App Store sign-in prompt and applies the RevenueCat project’s restore behavior when purchases belong to another app user ID. It throws "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured"},{"type":"text","text":" before configuration, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/verificationFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" for failed signature verification, or an SDK error."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".restorePurchases"},{"type":"text","text":" action wraps this call and dispatches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".customerInfoUpdated"},{"type":"text","text":" on success or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" on error."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Entitlement mapping","anchor":"Entitlement-mapping"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" the service receives:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entitlementID"},{"type":"text","text":" active"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"(next column)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entitlementID"},{"type":"text","text":" inactive or missing"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"(next column)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"permanentLicenseEntitlementID == nil"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"permanentLicenseEntitlementID"},{"type":"text","text":" active"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"permanentLicenseEntitlementID"},{"type":"text","text":" inactive or missing"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both flags are checked independently against the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":". A user with both active subscription and lifetime entitlements gets both flags set. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping"},{"type":"text","text":" for the reasoning behind the truth table."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/servicereference"]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywallService":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywallservice","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevenueCatPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService","kind":"symbol","title":"RevenueCatPaywallService","abstract":[{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer backed by RevenueCat’s "},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RevenueCatPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywallError/notConfigured":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywallerror\/notconfigured","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notConfigured","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","kind":"symbol","title":"RevenueCatPaywallError.notConfigured","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat has not been configured, so the requested operation cannot start."}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/UIComponentsReference":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/UIComponentsReference","kind":"article","title":"UI Components Reference","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for the ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifiers — the SwiftUI surface of ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/uicomponentsreference","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Implements "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" against "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Purchases.shared"},{"type":"text","text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for drop-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presentation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToImplementService":{"abstract":[{"text":"Wire ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" plugin so the store sees real-time entitlement updates from RevenueCat.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoimplementservice","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/Swid